{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>And they had not even made provisions for themselves.</b> Scripture declares the merit of Israel, for they believed in YHWH and in Moses His servant, and did not say, 'How shall we go out into the great and awesome wilderness without provisions?'" "<b>And behold,</b> this is the greatness of the trait of trust (bitaḥon), and for this the Holy One, blessed be He, praises them through the prophet, as it says (Jeremiah 2:2): ״זכרתי לך חסד נעוריך אהבת כלולותיך לכתך אחרי במדבר בארץ לא זרועה״."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:58:18.965553911Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}